			"notes": "### added\n\n- when an item you hold or wear wears down to 10 durability or less, it is moved to your inventory, like a shift-click.\n- if your inventory is full, the item is dropped on the ground instead.\n- a worn item held in the main hand can no longer mine or hit, so it cannot break that way.\n- client-side only: works in singleplayer & on any server, including vanilla ones."
